  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and juice lemon into a medium bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add oil, maple syrup, poppy seeds, salt, and pepper to the bowl with the lemon juice. Whisk to combine the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop walnuts. Add to the bowl with the dressing along with the raisins and carrots; stir to combine the salad."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide salad between bowls and enjoy!"
